{"data":{"print":{"id":"26497","name":"Screw Organising Tray (With Numbers)","slug":"screw-organising-tray-with-numbers","summary":"Ever disassembled something and worried that you might misplace on of the screws?","description":"<p>Ever disassembled something and worried that you might misplace on of the screws?</p>\n<p>Worry no more with this helpful screw organizer. With 16 different numbered areas to store your screws in, you'll not only keep them all in one place, but you can remember the order in which they were taken out as well.</p>\n<p>To make the text stand out even more, you can colour in the numbers with a black texta.</p>\n","nsfw":false,"tags":[{"id":"541","name":"diy"},{"id":"2201","name":"electronics"},{"id":"10771","name":"dissassemble"}],"user":{"id":"53657","handle":"ThatKid852_53657","publicUsername":"ThatKid852","avatarFilePath":"media/auth/avatars/38/38aaf8ff-4e5d-4921-92df-b25d37d74b16.jpg","verified":false},"license":{"id":"1","name":"Creative Commons \u2014 Attribution","disallowRemixing":false},"image":{"id":"132475","filePath":"media/prints/26497/images/275835_19872920-5411-471e-802b-a14ef0d33164/screw-organising-tray-with-screws.jpg"},"images":[{"id":"132475","filePath":"media/prints/26497/images/275835_19872920-5411-471e-802b-a14ef0d33164/screw-organising-tray-with-screws.jpg","rotation":0},{"id":"132474","filePath":"media/prints/26497/images/275836_263e0a2d-8dd0-46a3-8be6-0b8e1c628fcb/screw-organising-tray-no-screws.jpg","rotation":0},{"id":"132476","filePath":"media/prints/26497/images/275837_67d95109-1704-4112-a4b2-a0bf5a767427/screw-organising-tray-single-coloured-text.jpg","rotation":0}],"stls":[{"id":"110478","name":"screw-organising-tray.stl","fileSize":246084,"filePreviewPath":"media/prints/26497/stls/275829_d06bdbae-f5b9-40ec-8b63-24bfe6c54a46/screw-organising-tray_preview.png"},{"id":"110483","name":"screw-organising-tray.stp","fileSize":920152,"filePreviewPath":"media/prints/26497/previews/ef114d38-6b66-40c9-97dd-6d2ce3e3717c.